ow to implement the virtual assistant empowered with disease prediction and movie recommendation based on the mood that an inquisitive starter can understand, by integrating the concepts of Automatic speech recognition, Artificial Intelligence, Natural Language Processing, and Interprocess communication. Having a robust assistant improves the time efficiency as well as reduces the efforts to perform simple repetitive tasks.","topics":[],"score":245805,"global_rank":70250,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":12577},{"name":"privatekenny/rotation","owner":"privatekenny","html_url":"https://github.com/privatekenny/rotation","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":245796,"global_rank":70261,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":12578},{"name":"2Hurric/AdversarialVideoGeneration","owner":"2Hurric","html_url":"https://github.com/2Hurric/AdversarialVideoGeneration","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":1,"language":"Python","description":"This project was forked from dyelax\u2019s work and immigrated to TensorFlow1.2 and Python3, in order to be compatible to GTX1080 or later version GPU.","topics":[],"score":245794,"global_rank":70267,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":12579},{"name":"sadam-99/Neural-Networks","owner":"sadam-99","html_url":"https://github.com/sadam-99/Neural-Networks","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Trained Neural Network using different types of Activation functions like Sigmoid, ReLu, Tanh and compared their errors.","topics":[],"score":245794,"global_rank":70268,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":12580},{"name":"annieztang/FakesList","owner":"annieztang","html_url":"https://github.com/annieztang/FakesList","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":245794,"global_rank":70278,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":12581},{"name":"roh